        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we are not a car manufacturer and thus not directly subject to these standards, they may indirectly affect our business by sending a market signal for car manufacturers to adjust their EV offerings, potentially impacting demand for charging services over the long term.",
        "start_character": 54763,
        "end_character": 55041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From our frontline employees to our leadership roles, we have maintained a focus on attracting, developing and retaining a robust talent pipeline to remain competitive and to continue to provide our customers with the highest standard of service.",
        "start_character": 68687,
        "end_character": 68933
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In February 2026, we hosted our company-wide EVgo University event covering in-depth facets of our business, including our mission, vision and values, what we are doing to enhance our customer experience, our product and technology strategy including the use of artificial intelligence, and developing team building, including collaboration, as well as personal well-being.",
        "start_character": 69165,
        "end_character": 69538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the provision of EV charging infrastructure, we are continuing to develop and deploy innovative software-based, value-added services to drivers and partners.",
        "start_character": 3647,
        "end_character": 3819
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Other related services we currently provide to OEMs include co-marketing, data services, and digital application services.",
        "start_character": 18470,
        "end_character": 18592
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The benefits offered to Site Hosts through our business model continue to provide us with access to the highest quality sites that meet our return hurdles.",
        "start_character": 35845,
        "end_character": 36000
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The foundation of our business is building, owning and operating EV fast charging sites that deliver charging to EVs driven by individuals, commercial drivers and fleet operators.",
        "start_character": 423,
        "end_character": 602
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our dedicated fleet product, we develop, build, and service charging assets for fleets either at their own depot locations or at off-site charging hubs that we have secured.",
        "start_character": 19704,
        "end_character": 19885
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a variety of software-driven digital, development and operations services to customers.",
        "start_character": 20071,
        "end_character": 20172
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide grant application support and related services to our eXtend customers.",
        "start_character": 19451,
        "end_character": 19538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-024827",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on enhancing products and services to maintain a leadership position as a developer and operator of networked charging infrastructure.",
        "start_character": 26717,
        "end_character": 26866
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-024827",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-024827-8f53f1975b70db5b",
